  "description": "Tracks a Kenya SHA/NSHR outpatient visit workflow: patient-privacy consent request/verification (Consent status proposed then active); the visit, which begins with the general-opd EpisodeOfCare (status active) and ends when it is finished; patient check-in (registration Encounter); triage (vitals); consultation with diagnosis, medication order/dispense, an optional lab order and its result, and an optional procedure/imaging order and procedure; and an optional care summary (Composition). Medication-administration is intentionally not tracked - it is an inpatient concept. The Matcher Service correlates steps by patient, not by a single Encounter id.",
